<title>USA: Industrie Natuzzi to raise 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Industrie Natuzzi to raise 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrie Natuzzi SpA on Wednesday said its board recommended raising its 1996 dividend to 260 lira per ordinary share or American Depositary Share, up from 160 lira in 1995.</p>
<p>Earlier, the company said net earnings in 1996 rose to $1.34 a share from $1.04 the previous year.</p>
</text>
